        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEXA WORLD 3D - A Modern 3D Hex-Puzzle Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEXA WORLD 3D</strong> is an atmospheric 3D hex-puzzle game where you build towers of hexagonal tiles, trigger chain reactions, earn XP, and unlock new maps, tile skins, and tactical boosters.<br>The game blends strategy, a calm pace, and deep progression, creating a unique relaxing puzzle and cozy puzzle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/76cb64c903dad1c2c9739e31aaa4bdd2.poster.avif?t=1774156006\" width=848 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/76cb64c903dad1c2c9739e31aaa4bdd2.webm?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/76cb64c903dad1c2c9739e31aaa4bdd2.mp4?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay built on strategy and chain reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers of matching colors, create long chain reactions, plan your moves, and use tactical boosters to enhance your combinations or escape difficult situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/79e9434eb2a72d7ab75e250b808ec696.poster.avif?t=1774156006\" width=848 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/79e9434eb2a72d7ab75e250b808ec696.webm?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/79e9434eb2a72d7ab75e250b808ec696.mp4?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Game Modes:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Mode - where every level is always new</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels adapt to your player progression:<br>the higher your level, the more interesting and diverse the challenges become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only <strong>Level Mode</strong> generates a fresh set of conditions every time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >field shapes: hexagon, triangle, diamond, chaos, square</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique starting layouts of towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >locked cells based on player level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >difficulty affects the target score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new logical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/88672114af7313e85ed30e5b121b715d.poster.avif?t=1774156006\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/88672114af7313e85ed30e5b121b715d.webm?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/88672114af7313e85ed30e5b121b715d.mp4?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Competitive Mode - time-based puzzle challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulties:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy - 5 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medium - 4 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard - 3 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The field is the same for everyone - fair competition for high scores.<br>Climb the monthly leaderboard and improve your results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/2bf89e69cbef6c1abe43147c3994575f.poster.avif?t=1774156006\" width=848 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/2bf89e69cbef6c1abe43147c3994575f.webm?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/2bf89e69cbef6c1abe43147c3994575f.mp4?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinity Mode - a relaxing puzzle sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the shape of the field,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the size of the field,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the pace of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for calm sessions, long combos, and XP progression through threshold achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/5fb9e948f78f50fb7a549d155e7e7584.poster.avif?t=1774156006\" width=848 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/5fb9e948f78f50fb7a549d155e7e7584.webm?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/5fb9e948f78f50fb7a549d155e7e7584.mp4?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>XP Progression and Collections</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tile skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boosters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cosmetics and rare loot items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you unlock works in all game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Boosters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use boosters as strategic tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hammer</strong> - destroys any tower and grants points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuffle </strong>- refreshes the generator stacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocker</strong> - removes all locked cells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleanser</strong> - clears the field (except locked cells) without scoring</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boosters enhance combos and help in difficult situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/6ddf29ce28105bb223c38e997943a49c.poster.avif?t=1774156006\" width=848 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/6ddf29ce28105bb223c38e997943a49c.webm?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/6ddf29ce28105bb223c38e997943a49c.mp4?t=1774156006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEXA WORLD 3D is perfect for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >relaxing puzzle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >players who enjoy strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >score hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collectors of maps and tile skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fans of calm Infinite-style modes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress leaderboard - tracks your level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monthly Competitive leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special achievement for scoring <strong>10,000+ points</strong> in a single run</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savanna</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crimson Blossom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood Land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Land</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcoming locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steppe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shroomwood Grove</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/b9cce257d11e9ba02b0cd883c79ecd14.avif?t=1774156006\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Localization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports all major languages:<br><strong>EN, RU, DE, ES, FR, IT, PT-BR, KO, JA, ZH-Hans, ZH-Hant.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEXA WORLD 3D is a fully solo-developed puzzle game.</strong><br>Your feedback, ideas, and suggestions directly influence the development and future of the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Discord community</strong>!<br>Share feedback, participate in discussions, suggest improvements, help shape upcoming updates, or simply chat with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let’s develop HEXA WORLD 3D together!</strong></p>",
